25,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Wow, setting up every morning takes way longer than I thought. And those shuffles are a total mess!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The costs are quite rigid. We pay for the area regardless of how many people are actually sitting there.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems the window seats are a huge point of contention, and our arrival times are all over the place.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The noise levels vary significantly, and apparently, it takes days to get a workstation physically comfortable.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Sitting together really helps the new people learn and makes communication much faster. It's almost magic.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If we change seats too often, we'll just spend all our time packing boxes and plugging in cables.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Also, every time we move a desk, the facilities charge us a fee. It adds up quickly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"If we go with a first-come basis, the early birds always get the best spots. That's not fair.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Shion,,"Exactly. If I have to reset my chair and monitor every few days, my back will be ruined.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Yumi,,But we can't ignore how much we gain by being close. The organic learning is so valuable.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want to waste my short breaks on technical glitches every single morning.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We need a solution that minimizes both the immediate installation costs and the long-term billing waste.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,We need a system that doesn't just reward the people who arrive at eight in the morning.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Shion,,I need a spot where I can actually concentrate without the printer noise and keep my settings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I think we should prioritize the team's connection over the convenience of the furniture.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
